@namespace Lumeo.Docs.Shared.Showcases
@* Static exception (see ../README.md, and the pattern GanttChartShowcase/SchedulerShowcase use
   for the same reason): FlowCanvas lives in the satellite package Lumeo.Flow, lazy-loaded only
   on its own docs route (/components/flow-canvas) — the general /components catalog page never
   loads that assembly, so a live <FlowCanvas> here throws a TypeLoadException the instant
   CatalogCard mounts it (verified: "Could not load file or assembly 'Lumeo.Flow'").
   This renders a faithful miniature of the real chrome instead: the dot-grid background pattern,
   three node cards with their handle dots, and the same bezier/step edge shapes FlowGeometry
   produces — fixed markup, no engine, no live wiring. *@

<div class="w-full max-w-[22rem] h-32 rounded-md border border-border/60 relative overflow-hidden bg-background">
    <svg class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
            <pattern id="flow-showcase-dots" width="14" height="14" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <circle cx="1" cy="1" r="1" fill="var(--color-border)" />
            </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#flow-showcase-dots)" />
        <path d="M74,44 C104,44 104,26 134,26" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-muted-foreground)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.6" />
        <path d="M74,52 C104,52 104,78 134,78" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-muted-foreground)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.6" />
    </svg>

    <div class="absolute rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-medium text-card-foreground shadow-sm" style="left:8px;top:34px;">
        Intake
        <span class="absolute rounded-full border border-muted-foreground bg-background" style="width:6px;height:6px;right:-3px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-medium text-card-foreground shadow-sm" style="left:134px;top:18px;">
        <span class="absolute rounded-full border border-muted-foreground bg-background" style="width:6px;height:6px;left:-3px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);"></span>
        Score
    </div>
    <div class="absolute rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-medium text-card-foreground shadow-sm" style="left:134px;top:70px;">
        <span class="absolute rounded-full border border-muted-foreground bg-background" style="width:6px;height:6px;left:-3px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);"></span>
        Review
    </div>
</div>
